<title>USA: Forest Oil estimated proved reserves rise.</title>
<headline>Forest Oil estimated proved reserves rise.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forest Oil Corp said Tuesday its estimated proved reserves were 481 billion cubic feet of equivalents as of December 31, 1996, up from 301 billion cubic feet of equivalents at the end of the prior year.</p>
<p>The estimated proved reserves reported include 269 billion cubic feet of equivalents in the United States and 212 billion cubic feet of equivalents in Canada.</p>
</text>
